-- `permissive` would already break every write -- the single most likely way this
-- artifact ships green over a broken configuration. Enforcing withholds it on purpose
-- (backfills run as `projector_order`, never as the owner), which is what makes the owner's
-- `UPDATE 0` a correct refusal rather than a hole -- and what keeps FORCE observable.
